  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vamos Tejiendo: Equal Access to Quality Jobs for Women and Girls in Agriculture (EQUAL) in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EQUAL/Colombia aims to reduce the risk of child labor, forced labor, and other violations of labor rights by empowering vulnerable women and girls working in the production of unrefined brown sugar (panela) and the cut flowers sector and promoting a better understanding of labor rights.</narrative>
  </description>
